}

body:json {
  {
    "scope": {
      "kind": "subscribed"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Freeze a bulk-read selection without changing state. No cutoff returns publication boundaries; an age cutoff returns exact existing unread subject IDs plus calendar metadata. Clients split the selection into immutable PDS chunks. An excessive selection fails, never truncates.
}
